  "privacyIosSupplementTitle": "Additional information for iPhone",
  "privacyIosSupplementBody": "References below to Android, Google Play and Play Integrity apply only to Android. On iPhone you can sign in with Apple and hide your email address. Firebase also handles authentication. Apple handles subscriptions bought in the App Store; Sedno does not receive card details. Deleting your account does not cancel a subscription.\n\nApp Attest verifies the app’s authenticity. It does not send text, results or photos to Apple. The server stores pseudonymous installation and public key data. Challenges are valid for 5 minutes and keys for 90 days after the last successful session verification. Purchase notifications are kept for 30 days. A server job removes expired records. Purchase metadata is kept until account deletion.\n\nHistory is encrypted, stays on the device, is excluded from backups and expires after 7 days. Photos and audio stay on the device. Dictation and speech playback run locally only when supported by the device and language. You send recognised text to OpenAI through Sedno after accepting the AI notice.\n\nThe other information below, including controller details, purposes, legal bases and OpenAI practices, also applies to iPhone. Apple’s privacy policy: https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/",
